uirts out water with vigorous force."}, {"versions": ["leafgreen"], "text": "After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. It powerfully sprays foam from its mouth."}, {"versions": ["diamond", "pearl", "platinum", "black", "white", "x"], "text": "It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."}, {"versions": ["heartgold"], "text": "The shell is soft when it is born. It soon becomes so resilient, prodding fingers will bounce off it."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2"], "text": "It shelters itself in its shell then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."}, {"versions": ["omega-ruby", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Squirtle’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this Pokémon to swim at high speeds."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "When it feels threatened, it draws its limbs inside its shell and sprays water from its mouth."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-i": {"red-blue": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-i/red-blue/7.png", "shiny": null}, "yellow": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-i/yellow/7.png", "shiny": null}}, "generation-ii": {"crystal": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/crystal/7.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/crystal/shiny/7.png"}, "gold": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/gold/7.png", "shiny": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/generation-ii/gold/shiny/7.png"}, "silver": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/versions/gen